{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781372859590,"sessionID":"ses_13de7b10dffe1W0Dk7zSZKIM32","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"toolu_bdrk_01UGwHjkbQ592oLBwv477oNh","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/daniel-bo/Desktop/verbal/measure/tech-stack.md"},"output":"<path>/home/daniel-bo/Desktop/verbal/measure/tech-stack.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Technology Stack: Verbal\n2: \n3: ## Core Architecture\n4: - **Language:** Go\n5: - **UI Framework:** GTK4 + Libadwaita (via `gotk4` bindings)\n6: - **Media Engine:** GStreamer (via `gotk4-gstreamer` or custom bindings)\n7: - **Platform:** Native Linux (GNOME/Ubuntu focus)\n8: \n9: ## UI Layer (GTK)\n10: - **Editor:** GTK TextView or custom structured buffer for transcript editing.\n11: - **Timeline:** Custom GTK DrawingArea or composite widget for visual timeline representation.\n12: - **Preview:** GStreamer video sink integrated into GTK window (e.g., `gtksink`).\n13: - **Design:** Libadwaita for modern, GNOME-native aesthetics (Dark mode focus).\n14: \n15: ## Backend & Media Processing\n16: - **Recording:** \n17:     - Webcam: `v4l2src` (Video4Linux2)\n18:     - Audio: `pulsesrc` / `pipewiresrc` (PulseAudio / PipeWire)\n19: - **Playback:** GStreamer `playbin` or custom pipeline for frame-accurate seeking and text-synced cursor updates.\n20: - **Transcoding & Export:** GStreamer `encodebin` using:\n21:     - Video: H.264 (`x264enc`) or VP9 (`vp9enc`)\n22:     - Audio: WAV or AAC\n23:     - Optimization: Stream-copy (`copy` muxing) where possible for fast, lossless cuts.\n24: - **Storage:** \n25:     - Database: SQLite (via `modernc.org/sqlite` or `mattn/go-sqlite3`) for project and media metadata.\n26:     - File System: Local project structure for storing transcripts (JSON) and original/edited media files.\n27: \n28: ## AI Integration Layer\n29: - **Providers:** \n30:     - OpenAI (Whisper API)\n31:     - Google (Speech-to-Text)\n32: - **Architecture:** Go-based async job system for handling cloud API requests and processing responses into word-level timestamped objects.\n33: \n34: ## Non-Functional Requirements\n35: - **Display Server:** Wayland (primary) + X11 (compatibility).\n36: - **Concurrency:** Go routines for non-blocking media processing and UI events.\n37: - **Latency:** Seek response < 100ms.\n\n(End of file - total 37 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Technology Stack: Verbal\n\n## Core Architecture\n- **Language:** Go\n- **UI Framework:** GTK4 + Libadwaita (via `gotk4` bindings)\n- **Media Engine:** GStreamer (via `gotk4-gstreamer` or custom bindings)\n- **Platform:** Native Linux (GNOME/Ubuntu focus)\n\n## UI Layer (GTK)\n- **Editor:** GTK TextView or custom structured buffer for transcript editing.\n- **Timeline:** Custom GTK DrawingArea or composite widget for visual timeline representation.\n- **Preview:** GStreamer video sink integrated into GTK window (e.g., `gtksink`).\n- **Design:** Libadwaita for modern, GNOME-native aesthetics (Dark mode focus).\n\n## Backend & Media Processing\n- **Recording:** \n    - Webcam: `v4l2src` (Video4Linux2)\n    - Audio: `pulsesrc` / `pipewiresrc` (PulseAudio / PipeWire)\n- **Playback:** GStreamer `playbin` or custom pipeline for frame-accurate seeking and text-synced cursor updates.\n- **Transcoding & Export:** GStreamer `encodebin` using:","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/daniel-bo/Desktop/verbal/measure/tech-stack.md","text":"# Technology Stack: Verbal\n\n## Core Architecture\n- **Language:** Go\n- **UI Framework:** GTK4 + Libadwaita (via `gotk4` bindings)\n- **Media Engine:** GStreamer (via `gotk4-gstreamer` or custom bindings)\n- **Platform:** Native Linux (GNOME/Ubuntu focus)\n\n## UI Layer (GTK)\n- **Editor:** GTK TextView or custom structured buffer for transcript editing.\n- **Timeline:** Custom GTK DrawingArea or composite widget for visual timeline representation.\n- **Preview:** GStreamer video sink integrated into GTK window (e.g., `gtksink`).\n- **Design:** Libadwaita for modern, GNOME-native aesthetics (Dark mode focus).\n\n## Backend & Media Processing\n- **Recording:** \n    - Webcam: `v4l2src` (Video4Linux2)\n    - Audio: `pulsesrc` / `pipewiresrc` (PulseAudio / PipeWire)\n- **Playback:** GStreamer `playbin` or custom pipeline for frame-accurate seeking and text-synced cursor updates.\n- **Transcoding & Export:** GStreamer `encodebin` using:\n    - Video: H.264 (`x264enc`) or VP9 (`vp9enc`)\n    - Audio: WAV or AAC\n    - Optimization: Stream-copy (`copy` muxing) where possible for fast, lossless cuts.\n- **Storage:** \n    - Database: SQLite (via `modernc.org/sqlite` or `mattn/go-sqlite3`) for project and media metadata.\n    - File System: Local project structure for storing transcripts (JSON) and original/edited media files.\n\n## AI Integration Layer\n- **Providers:** \n    - OpenAI (Whisper API)\n    - Google (Speech-to-Text)\n- **Architecture:** Go-based async job system for handling cloud API requests and processing responses into word-level timestamped objects.\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n- **Display Server:** Wayland (primary) + X11 (compatibility).\n- **Concurrency:** Go routines for non-blocking media processing and UI events.\n- **Latency:** Seek response < 100ms.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":37,"totalLines":37,"truncated":false}},"title":"measure/tech-stack.md","time":{"start":1781372858206,"end":1781372859566}},"id":"prt_ec218ace7001iKbApxqPkP6lue","sessionID":"ses_13de7b10dffe1W0Dk7zSZKIM32","messageID":"msg_ec2188cc7001qZOkRyDaIcyavc"}}
